OL,3,GNEWSAPlans being developed for new
OL,4,Acollege campus in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans are being drawn up to create a
OL,7,Fnew college campus in Derby to train
OL,8,Fengineers and skilled industrial
OL,9,Fworkers.
OL,11,FOfficials have earmarked Lonsdale House
OL,12,Fin Lodge Lane to become a new campus
OL,13,Ffor 16 to 18-year-olds, which will be
OL,14,Fled by the University of Derby, the
OL,15,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service said.
OL,17,FThe plan is to provide future talent
OL,18,Ffor Derby's key sectors of aerospace,
OL,19,Frail, nuclear, advanced manufacturing
OL,20,Fand clean energy.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
